 verifies if all the Work Order Operations of the Work Order are in final state.\r\nIf they are, it completes the Work Order.\r\nOtherwise it starts the following Work Order Operations by increasing sequence if two conditions are filled: the operations must have IsInExecutionPropagation set to True and there is no planned start date.","FullInfo":"Updates the ActualEndTime field of the Work Order Operation. \r\nAdditionally it verifies if all the Work Order Operations of the Work Order are in final state.\r\nIf they are, it completes the Work Order.\r\nOtherwise it starts the following Work Order Operations by increasing sequence if two conditions are filled: the operations must have IsInExecutionPropagation set to True and there is no planned start date.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"5249"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Updates the ActualEndTime field of the Work Order Operation. \r\nAdditionally it verifies if all the Work Order Operations of the Work Order are in final state.\r\nIf they are, it completes the Work Order.\r\nOtherwise it starts the following Work Order Operations by increasing sequence if two conditions are filled: the operations must have IsInExecutionPropagation set to True and there is no planned start date.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Updates the ActualEndTime field of the Work Order Operation. \r\nAdditionally it verifies if all the Work Order Operations of the Work Order are in final state.\r\nIf they are, it completes the Work Order.\r\nOtherwise it starts the following Work Order Operations by increasing sequence if two conditions are filled: the operations must have IsInExecutionPropagation set to True and there is no planned start date."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"5250","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4801"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnn