b1c3-a8709bb1f2be","Name":"UpdateWorkOrderOperationExtended","FullInfo":"Siemens.SimaticIT.UAPI.OperationalData.PICore_OP.OPModel.Commands.UpdateWorkOrderOperationExtended","TypeResolved":"","_project":{"$ref":"12"},"_domain":{"$ref":"4804"}}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"5640"},"Children":[],"Name":"CommandName","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4801"},"Documentation":{"$id":"5641","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"Resets and/or Updates one or more properties of a Work Order Operation and its extension. The command resets a property when it has been set to empty and updates its value, if specified.\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, during its execution:\r\n* -10948: The Work Order Operation does not exist.\r\n* -10996: The Work Master Operation has not been found.\r\n* -11314: The Estimated Duration cannot be negative.\r\n* -10996: The piece of Equipment set as Actual Equipment has not been found.\r\n* -11311: Planned Start Time cannot be equal to or later than the Planned End Time.\r\n* -10979: Actual Start Time cannot be equal to or later than the Actual End Time.\r\n* -10981: The Update of the Work Order Operation failed.\r\n* -10982: The creation of the Task for the specified Work Order has failed.\r\n","FullInfo":"Resets and/or Updates one or more properties of a Work Order Operation and its extension. The command resets a property when it has been set to empty and updates its value, if specified.\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, during its execution:\r\n* -10948: The Work Order Operation does not exist.\r\n* -10996: The Work Master Operation has not been found.\r\n* -11314: The Estimated Duration cannot be negative.\r\n* -10996: The piece of Equipment set as Actual Equipment has not been found.\r\n* -11311: Planned Start Time cannot be equal to or later than the Planned End Time.\r\n* -10979: Actual Start Time cannot be equal to or later than the Actual End Time.\r\n* -10981: The Update of the Work Order Operation failed.\r\n* -10982: The c