rozen.\r\n* -11311: Planned Start Time cannot be equal to or later than the Planned End Time.\r\n* -10979: Actual Start Time cannot be equal to or later than the Actual End Time.\r\n* -10807: The Material does not exist.\r\n* -10855: No Material is set as current.\r\n* -10002: Not compatible unit of measures.\r\n* -10957: There is no Operation referencing a current Operation.\r\n* -10956: There is no Operation that references the specified Operation.\r\n* -10984: The State Machine is not valid, because it has no initial Status.\r\n* -10981: The specified Work Order Operation could not be updated.","FullInfo":"Resets and/or Updates one or more editable properties of a Work Order and its Work Order Extended. The command resets a property when it has been modified to empty and updates a property when it has been modified to a new value.\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, during its execution:\r\n* -10934: The Work Order has not been found.\r\n* -10992: The Work Order is frozen.\r\n* -11311: Planned Start Time cannot be equal to or later than the Planned End Time.\r\n* -10979: Actual Start Time cannot be equal to or later than the Actual End Time.\r\n* -10807: The Material does not exist.\r\n* -10855: No Material is set as current.\r\n* -10002: Not compatible unit of measures.\r\n* -10957: There is no Operation referencing a current Operation.\r\n* -10956: There is no Operation that references the specified Operation.\r\n* -10984: The State Machine is not valid, because it has no initial Status.\r\n* -10981: The specified Work Order Operation could not be updated.","InfoMap":{"$id":"7537","FullIdObj":{"$id":"7538","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Resets and/or Updates one or more editable properties of a Work Order and its Work Order Extended. The command resets a property when it has been modified to empty and updates a property when it has been modified to a new value.\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, during its execution:\r\n*