:{"$ref":"8767"},"Children":[],"Name":"CommandName","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4801"},"Documentation":{"$id":"8768","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"Associates a list of MTUs and/or Material Lots and/or Material Tracking Unit Aggregates  to a Work Order Operation Material Requirement.  \r\nThe Command checks: \r\nIf the Work Order Operation has any Material Requirement, if not Error  -10940 is returned. \r\nIf there is at least one MTU to add , if not the Command returns an empty list as an answer. ","FullInfo":"Associates a list of MTUs and/or Material Lots and/or Material Tracking Unit Aggregates  to a Work Order Operation Material Requirement.  \r\nThe Command checks: \r\nIf the Work Order Operation has any Material Requirement, if not Error  -10940 is returned. \r\nIf there is at least one MTU to add , if not the Command returns an empty list as an answer. ","InfoMap":{"$id":"8769","FullIdObj":{"$id":"8770","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Associates a list of MTUs and/or Material Lots and/or Material Tracking Unit Aggregates  to a Work Order Operation Material Requirement.  \r\nThe Command checks: \r\nIf the Work Order Operation has any Material Requirement, if not Error  -10940 is returned. \r\nIf there is at least one MTU to add , if not the Command returns an empty list as an answer. ","FullInfo":"Associates a list of MTUs and/or Material Lots and/or Material Tracking Unit Aggregates  to a Work Order Operation Material Requirement.  \r\nThe Command checks: \r\nIf the Work Order Operation has any Material Requirement, if not Error  -10940 is returned. \r\nIf there is at least one MTU to add , if not the Command returns an empty list as an answer. ","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"8770"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Associates a list of MTUs and/or Material Lots and/or Material Tracking Unit Aggregates  to a Work Order Operation Material Requirement.  \r\nThe Command che