d":"9810","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"Creates and starts a work process for an entity. \r\nChecks that the process definition exists for the given revision, that the revision is set as current, and that the process definition is set as executable. Errors raised: 11200 if not executable, 10889 if revision is undefined and there is no current revision, 10895 if no process definition exists with the given revision.","FullInfo":"Creates and starts a work process for an entity. \r\nChecks that the process definition exists for the given revision, that the revision is set as current, and that the process definition is set as executable. Errors raised: 11200 if not executable, 10889 if revision is undefined and there is no current revision, 10895 if no process definition exists with the given revision.","InfoMap":{"$id":"9811","FullIdObj":{"$id":"9812","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Creates and starts a work process for an entity. \r\nChecks that the process definition exists for the given revision, that the revision is set as current, and that the process definition is set as executable. Errors raised: 11200 if not executable, 10889 if revision is undefined and there is no current revision, 10895 if no process definition exists with the given revision.","FullInfo":"Creates and starts a work process for an entity. \r\nChecks that the process definition exists for the given revision, that the revision is set as current, and that the process definition is set as executable. Errors raised: 11200 if not executable, 10889 if revision is undefined and there is no current revision, 10895 if no process definition exists with the given revision.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"9812"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Creates and starts a work process for an entity. \r\nChecks that the process definition exists for the given revision, that the revision is set as current, and that the process definition is set as executable. Errors raised: 11200 if not executable, 10889 if revision is undefined and there is no current revision, 10895 if no process definition exists with the given revision.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Creates and starts a work process for an entity. \r\nChecks that the process definition exists for the given revision, that the revision is set as current, and that the process definition is set as executable. Errors raised: 11200 if not executable, 10889 if revision is undefined and there is no current revision, 10895 if no process definition exists with the given revision."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"9813","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Protected","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4801"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Protected","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Protected"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"9814","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(f541c6b6-ad0d-4b91-9875-5a2c5765643f)","FullInfo":"@Guid(f541c6b6-ad0d-4b91-9875-5a2c5765643f)","InfoMap":{"$id":"9815","FullIdObj":{"$id":"9816","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(f541c6b6-ad0d-4b91-9875-5a2c5765643f)","FullInfo":"@Guid(f541c6b6-ad0d-4b91-9875-5a2c5765643f)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"9816"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4801"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(f541c6b6-ad0d-4b91-9875-5a2c5765643f)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(f541c6b6-ad0d-4b91-9875-5a2c5765643f)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"StartNewWorkProcessFromEntity","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"StartNewWorkProcessFromEntity"},{"$id":"9817","$type":"DslCommandInputDeclarationTree","Children":[{"$id":"9818","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"WITH","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4801"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_te