rk Order Operation with the specified NId does not exist.\r\n* Error -10843: There is no Process Definition with NId and revision linked to the Operation.\r\n* Error -11347: The Process Definition with specified NId and Revision is not for Manual Execution.\r\n* Error -11348: The Process Definition with specified NId and Revision has been already executed.","InfoMap":{"$id":"11046","FullIdObj":{"$id":"11047","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Removes the link between the Work Order Operation and one or more Process Definitions.\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, if some checks on input parameters fail:\r\n* Error -10300: The Work Order Operation with the specified NId does not exist.\r\n* Error -10843: There is no Process Definition with NId and revision linked to the Operation.\r\n* Error -11347: The Process Definition with specified NId and Revision is not for Manual Execution.\r\n* Error -11348: The Process Definition with specified NId and Revision has been already executed.","FullInfo":"Removes the link between the Work Order Operation and one or more Process Definitions.\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, if some checks on input parameters fail:\r\n* Error -10300: The Work Order Operation with the specified NId does not exist.\r\n* Error -10843: There is no Process Definition with NId and revision linked to the Operation.\r\n* Error -11347: The Process Definition with specified NId and Revision is not for Manual Execution.\r\n* Error -11348: The Process Definition with specified NId and Revision has been already executed.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"11047"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Removes the link between the Work Order Operation and one or more Process Definitions.\r\nThe command may return the following error codes, if some checks on input parameters fail:\r\n* Error -10300: The Work Order Operation with the specified NId