f there is between the related Work Order Operation and the new Work Process (IWorkOrderOperationWorkProcess) and it creates the link if it is missing.","InfoMap":{"$id":"11982","FullIdObj":{"$id":"11983","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the StartNewWorkProcess Command. \r\nIn case the new Work Process is a sub Work Process, this Post-Command copies the PIProcessDefinitionContext Process Context Definition of the parent Work Process (if it exists) to the new Work Process.\r\nThis Post-Command also verifies if there is between the related Work Order Operation and the new Work Process (IWorkOrderOperationWorkProcess) and it creates the link if it is missing.","FullInfo":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the StartNewWorkProcess Command. \r\nIn case the new Work Process is a sub Work Process, this Post-Command copies the PIProcessDefinitionContext Process Context Definition of the parent Work Process (if it exists) to the new Work Process.\r\nThis Post-Command also verifies if there is between the related Work Order Operation and the new Work Process (IWorkOrderOperationWorkProcess) and it creates the link if it is missing.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"11983"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the StartNewWorkProcess Command. \r\nIn case the new Work Process is a sub Work Process, this Post-Command copies the PIProcessDefinitionContext Process Context Definition of the parent Work Process (if it exists) to the new Work Process.\r\nThis Post-Command also verifies if there is between the related Work Order Operation and the new Work Process (IWorkOrderOperationWorkProcess) and it creates the link if it is missing.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the StartNewWorkProcess Command. \r\nIn case the new Work Process is a sub Work Process, this Post-Command copies the PIProcessDefinitionContext Process Context Definition of the parent Work Process (if it exists) to the new Work Process.\r\nThis Post-Command also verifies if there is between the related Work Order Operation and the new Work Process (IWorkOrderOperationWorkProcess) and it creates the link if it is missing."},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"11984","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(cec7d94e-1cf5-4c8a-bb68-dc4d4dbd3ab1)","FullInfo":"@Guid(cec7d94e-1cf5-4c8a-bb68-dc4d4dbd3ab1)","InfoMap":{"$id":"11985","FullIdObj":{"$id":"11986","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(cec7d94e-1cf5-4c8a-bb68-dc4d4dbd3ab1)","FullInfo":"@Guid(cec7d94e-1cf5-4c8a-bb68-dc4d4dbd3ab1)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"11986"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4801"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(cec7d94e-1cf5-4c8a-bb68-dc4d4dbd3ab1)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(cec7d94e-1cf5-4c8a-bb68-dc4d4dbd3ab1)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"FinalizeWorkProcessStarted","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"FinalizeWorkProcessStarted"},{"$id":"11987","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"StartNewWorkProcess","FullInfo":"Siemens.SimaticIT.OperationalData.BPF_OP.OPModel.Commands.StartNewWorkProcess","InfoMap":{"$id":"11988","FullIdObj":{"$id":"11989","$type":"IdentificableObject","Guid":"a2ffc3f8-f2b3-413e-91d1-4bf7f6e356be","Name":"StartNewWorkProcess","FullInfo":"Siemens.SimaticIT.OperationalData.BPF_OP.OPModel.Commands.StartNewWorkProcess","TypeResolved":"","_project":{"$ref":"10025"},"_domain":{"$id":"11990","$type":"IdentificableDomain","Guid":"f7357c80-80db-4082-970f-3427c5ec0def","Name":"Commands","FullInfo":"Siemens.SimaticIT.OperationalData.BPF_OP.OPModel.Commands","ServiceKind":4,"TypeResolved":"","SubDomainGuids":{"$id":"11991"},"_project":{"$ref":"10025"}}}},"FullIdObj":{"$re