ask output parameters with the Parameter Requirements of the associated Work Order Operation or with the properties of associated equipment, in case Parameter Requirements do not exist.\r\nThe command updates the parameters only if Common Context is associated with the Task Definition and the User Field Update_Task_Output_Parameters_By_Equipment of the Common Context is set to True.","FullInfo":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the ChangeTaskStatusOnAction Command.\r\nUpdates the task output parameters with the Parameter Requirements of the associated Work Order Operation or with the properties of associated equipment, in case Parameter Requirements do not exist.\r\nThe command updates the parameters only if Common Context is associated with the Task Definition and the User Field Update_Task_Output_Parameters_By_Equipment of the Common Context is set to True.","InfoMap":{"$id":"12130","FullIdObj":{"$id":"12131","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the ChangeTaskStatusOnAction Command.\r\nUpdates the task output parameters with the Parameter Requirements of the associated Work Order Operation or with the properties of associated equipment, in case Parameter Requirements do not exist.\r\nThe command updates the parameters only if Common Context is associated with the Task Definition and the User Field Update_Task_Output_Parameters_By_Equipment of the Common Context is set to True.","FullInfo":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the ChangeTaskStatusOnAction Command.\r\nUpdates the task output parameters with the Parameter Requirements of the associated Work Order Operation or with the properties of associated equipment, in case Parameter Requirements do not exist.\r\nThe command updates the parameters only if Common Context is associated with the Task Definition and the User Field Update_Task_Output_Parameters_By_Equipment of the Common Context is set to True.","TypeResolved":"