be started again, till the manufacturing work process of the Work Order completes.","FullInfo":"This post action is executed when a Work Process of a Process Definition having the context PISampleDefinitionContext, completes. If the inspection frequency is Part Based or Unit Based, an event is fired and a Sample is created and the system reduces the inspection execution counter. If the inspection frequency is Time based, the system checks if the Timer must be reset and a new instance of the Work Process must be started again, till the manufacturing work process of the Work Order completes.","InfoMap":{"$id":"12228","FullIdObj":{"$id":"12229","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"This post action is executed when a Work Process of a Process Definition having the context PISampleDefinitionContext, completes. If the inspection frequency is Part Based or Unit Based, an event is fired and a Sample is created and the system reduces the inspection execution counter. If the inspection frequency is Time based, the system checks if the Timer must be reset and a new instance of the Work Process must be started again, till the manufacturing work process of the Work Order completes.","FullInfo":"This post action is executed when a Work Process of a Process Definition having the context PISampleDefinitionContext, completes. If the inspection frequency is Part Based or Unit Based, an event is fired and a Sample is created and the system reduces the inspection execution counter. If the inspection frequency is Time based, the system checks if the Timer must be reset and a new instance of the Work Process must be started again, till the manufacturing work process of the Work Order completes.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"12229"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"This post action is executed when a Work Process of a Process Definition having the context PISampleDefinitionContext, completes. If the inspection frequency is Part Based or Unit Based, an event is fired and a Sample is created and the system reduces the inspection execution counter. If the inspection frequency is Time based, the system checks if the Timer must be reset and a new instance of the Work Process must be started again, till the manufacturing work process of the Work Order completes.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"This post action is executed when a Work Process of a Process Definition having the context PISampleDefinitionContext, completes. If the inspection frequency is Part Based or Unit Based, an event is fired and a Sample is created and the system reduces the inspection execution counter. If the inspection frequency is Time based, the system checks if the Timer must be reset and a new instance of the Work Process must be started again, till the manufacturing work process of the Work Order completes."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"12230","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Optional","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4801"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Optional","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Optional"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"12231","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(4ae03db4-a3c6-40fb-b924-3b6e5c4433c6)","FullInfo":"@Guid(4ae03db4-a3c6-40fb-b924-3b6e5c4433c6)","InfoMap":{"$id":"12232","FullIdObj":{"$id":"12233","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(4ae03db4-a3c6-40fb-b924-3b6e5c4433c6)","FullInfo":"@Guid(4ae03db4-a3c6-40fb-b924-3b6e5c4433c6)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"12233"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4801"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(4ae03db4-a3c6-40fb-b924-3b6e5c4433c6)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(4ae03db4-a3c6-40fb-b924-3b6e5c4433c6)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"SampleDefintionWorkProcessCompleted","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Te