nContext, completes. If the inspection frequency is Part Based or Unit Based, an event is fired and a Sample is created and the system reduces the inspection execution counter. If the inspection frequency is Time based, the system checks if the Timer must be reset and a new instance of the Work Process must be started again, till the manufacturing work process of the Work Order completes.","InfoMap":{"$id":"12298","FullIdObj":{"$id":"12299","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"This post action is executed when a Work Process of a Process Definition having the context PIInspectionDefinitionContext, completes. If the inspection frequency is Part Based or Unit Based, an event is fired and a Sample is created and the system reduces the inspection execution counter. If the inspection frequency is Time based, the system checks if the Timer must be reset and a new instance of the Work Process must be started again, till the manufacturing work process of the Work Order completes.","FullInfo":"This post action is executed when a Work Process of a Process Definition having the context PIInspectionDefinitionContext, completes. If the inspection frequency is Part Based or Unit Based, an event is fired and a Sample is created and the system reduces the inspection execution counter. If the inspection frequency is Time based, the system checks if the Timer must be reset and a new instance of the Work Process must be started again, till the manufacturing work process of the Work Order completes.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"12299"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"This post action is executed when a Work Process of a Process Definition having the context PIInspectionDefinitionContext, completes. If the inspection frequency is Part Based or Unit Based, an event is fired and a Sample is created and the system reduces the inspection execution counter. If the inspection frequency is Time based, the system checks if the Timer must be reset and a new instance of the Work Process must be started again, till the manufacturing work process of the Work Order completes.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"This post action is executed when a Work Process of a Process Definition having the context PIInspectionDefinitionContext, completes. If the inspection frequency is Part Based or Unit Based, an event is fired and a Sample is created and the system reduces the inspection execution counter. If the inspection frequency is Time based, the system checks if the Timer must be reset and a new instance of the Work Process must be started again, till the manufacturing work process of the Work Order completes."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"12300","$type":"DslKeywordNode","Text":"Optional","Children":[],"Name":"Keyword","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4801"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Optional","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Optional"}],"CustomAnnotations":[{"$id":"12301","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"@Guid(4d0ae23e-1f98-482d-9bcb-9bfaeb2e98a6)","FullInfo":"@Guid(4d0ae23e-1f98-482d-9bcb-9bfaeb2e98a6)","InfoMap":{"$id":"12302","FullIdObj":{"$id":"12303","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"@Guid(4d0ae23e-1f98-482d-9bcb-9bfaeb2e98a6)","FullInfo":"@Guid(4d0ae23e-1f98-482d-9bcb-9bfaeb2e98a6)","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"12303"},"Children":[],"Name":"CustomAnnotation","ScriptInfo":{"$ref":"4801"},"SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"@Guid(4d0ae23e-1f98-482d-9bcb-9bfaeb2e98a6)","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"@Guid(4d0ae23e-1f98-482d-9bcb-9bfaeb2e98a6)"}],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"InspectionDefinitionWorkProcessCompleted","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"InspectionDefinitionWorkProcessCompleted"},{"$id":"12304","$type":"DslTerminalNode","Text":"CompleteWorkProcess","FullInfo":"Siemens.SimaticIT.OperationalData.BPF_OP.OPModel.Comma