eating the link if it is missing.","FullInfo":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the **CreateOnlyWorkProcess** command. \r\nIn case the new Work Process is a sub Work Process, copies the Process Context Definition of the parent Work Process to the new Work Process.\r\nVerifies if there is an association between the new Work Process and the related Work Order Operation, creating the link if it is missing.","InfoMap":{"$id":"12635","FullIdObj":{"$id":"12636","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the **CreateOnlyWorkProcess** command. \r\nIn case the new Work Process is a sub Work Process, copies the Process Context Definition of the parent Work Process to the new Work Process.\r\nVerifies if there is an association between the new Work Process and the related Work Order Operation, creating the link if it is missing.","FullInfo":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the **CreateOnlyWorkProcess** command. \r\nIn case the new Work Process is a sub Work Process, copies the Process Context Definition of the parent Work Process to the new Work Process.\r\nVerifies if there is an association between the new Work Process and the related Work Order Operation, creating the link if it is missing.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"12636"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the **CreateOnlyWorkProcess** command. \r\nIn case the new Work Process is a sub Work Process, copies the Process Context Definition of the parent Work Process to the new Work Process.\r\nVerifies if there is an association between the new Work Process and the related Work Order Operation, creating the link if it is missing.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"This Post-Command is triggered after the execution of the **CreateOnlyWorkProcess** command. \r\nIn case the new Work